<title>FRANCE: Plastic Omnium 1997 H1 sales up five pct.</title>
<headline>Plastic Omnium 1997 H1 sales up five pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 3,986    vs    3,800</p>
<p>NOTE - Plastic Omnium said in a statement that 1997 first-half sales rose five percent. On a comparable basis, they rose six percent, it said.</p>
<p>First-half sales rose 6.2 percent to 3.04 billion francs in the main auto components branch, they fell 0.7 percent in the urban systems branch and rose 3.5 percent in the plastics products and Plastic Omnium medical branch.</p>
<p>Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
